e (ACTH). Overall, glucocorticoids are significant in both therapeutic applications and physiological responses within the body.\",9\r\n5083,MITOTANO,\"Mitotano is a medication primarily used for the symptomatic treatment of advanced adrenal carcinoma, specifically in cases that are inoperable, metastatic, or recurrent. It functions by inhibiting several enzymes involved in steroidogenesis and exhibits adrenolytic effects. Additionally, Mitotano can induce the enzyme CYP3A4, which may influence the metabolism of other drugs. This multifaceted approach makes Mitotano a critical option in managing advanced adrenocortical carcinoma.\",11\r\n5223,CARCINOMA SUPRARRENAL PRIMARIO,\"Carcinoma suprarrenal primario is a rare cancer with an incidence of 1 in 1,000,000 inhabitants per year, more frequently affecting women than men.\",4\r\n5574,CYP3A4,\"CYP3A4 is the most important member of the CYP450 family, responsible for the metabolism of approximately half of the drugs used in human therapy.\",5\r\n4050,MINERALOCORTICOIDES,\"Mineralocorticoides son una clase de hormonas esteroides que desempeñan un papel crucial en la regulación del equilibrio de electrolitos en el cuerpo, específicamente en la regulación de los niveles de sodio y potasio. Estas hormonas, que se producen principalmente en la zona glomerulosa de la corteza adrenal, influyen en la presión arterial y el balance de fluidos. Además, los mineralocorticoides pueden afectar la excreción de magnesio, lo que resalta su importancia en la homeostasis electrolítica general.\",3\r\n5220,ADRENOCORTICAL CARCINOMA,\"Adrenocortical carcinoma is a rare cancer of the adrenal cortex, with an incidence of 1 in 1,000,000 people per year, often requiring surgical intervention for localized disease.\",1\r\n5577,ANTIBIÓTICOS MACRÓLIDOS,\"Macrolide antibiotics are drugs that can inhibit CYP3A4, affecting the metabolism of other medications.\",1\r\n5576,ANTIFÚNGICOS,\"Antifungals are drugs that can inhibit the enzyme CYP3A4, necessit